 R←Test_Select_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;ind;qdmx
⍝ Exercise "Select" with automation using the "a~3 4 6" (all but 3 4 6) syntax
⍝ The syntax was introduced in 2.1.0
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 list←⌽'file_'∘,¨⍕¨⍳10
 list←'/path/2/folder/'∘,¨list
 C.AddAutomation'Select' 'Select a file:' 'a~3 4 6'
 ind←'Select a file:'C.Select list
 →T.GoToTidyUp ind≢(⍳≢list)~3 4 6
 →T.GoToTidyUp 7≢≢ind

 1 C.AddAutomation'Select' 'Select a file:' 'a~'      ⍝ Invalid
 ind←'Select a file:'C.Select list
 →T.GoToTidyUp ind≢⍳≢list
 →T.GoToTidyUp 10≢≢ind

 1 C.AddAutomation'Select' 'Select a file:' 'a~99'    ⍝ Exclude non-existing
 ind←'Select a file:'C.Select list
 →T.GoToTidyUp ind≢⍳≢list
 →T.GoToTidyUp 10≢≢ind

 :Trap 11
     1 C.AddAutomation'Select' 'Select a file:' 'a~1 q 3'    ⍝ Partly invalid
     {}'Select a file:'C.Select list
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp'Invalid "without"'≢qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 C.Cleanup
⍝Done
